@nsobid-82D187FE9EF9BE921B8E1B1CDDF7BD287CDB22C1

# Xenoblade Chronicles 3 v2.2.0 - high frame rate on top of 60fps_2.2.0.pchtxt (xc3-recomp, milestone M5)
# The frame cap is then applied by the runtime (XRT_FPS_CAP, default 120; 0 = uncapped).

@flag offset_shift 0x100

@enabled
// frame-time clamp: minimum 1/480 s instead of 1/120 (cave of the 60fps patch: fmov s2, #8.0)
00ECD794 0210241E
// maximum = the 60 fps frame time (ldr s2, [x19, #0x214]) instead of twice the minimum
0000F408 621642BD
// game speed factor kept at frame time x 30 (fmov s2, #3.75 = 30 / 8)
0000F42C 02D0211E
// the game's own frame limiter (busy-wait to 0.997 x 1/60 s): threshold 0
0124FACC 16008052
0124FAD0 1F2003D5
@stop
